         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introducción\n\nCuando salimos de casa hacia un parque, una escuela o un mercado, normalmente regresamos después.\n\nEn las clases anteriores aprendimos a imaginar los números creciendo en un camino, avanzando siempre hacia donde aumentan. En esta clase aprenderemos a caminar de vuelta.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "eaf6bd4e-9f68-4945-ae49-1e4e46321975",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "eaf6bd4e-9f68-4945-ae49-1e4e46321975",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "3918f1d9-8d7f-439f-8f76-e5c4ef741b5e",
               "text": "Weisstein, Eric W.",
               "page": "https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Axis.html",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Recordando los Ejes\n\nRecordemos el camino que construimos con algunos números marcados. Llamamos a ese camino un **eje**.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg width=\"450\" height=\"100\"  fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"> <defs> <marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"> <path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" /></marker> </defs> <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"15\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" /> <text x=\"0\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">0</text> <text x=\"40\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">1</text> <text x=\"80\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">2</text> <text x=\"120\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">3</text> <text x=\"160\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">4</text> <text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">5</text> <text x=\"240\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">6</text> <text x=\"280\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">7</text> <text x=\"320\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">8</text> <text x=\"360\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"1.5em\">9</text> <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"85\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"125\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"165\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"205\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"205\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"245\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"285\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"285\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"325\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"325\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" /> <line x1=\"365\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" />  </svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Gráfico 1: Representación de un eje con números. Los números se colocan debajo de la línea, y una flecha en el extremo derecho indica la dirección en que los números crecen.</b></p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "c2dc5fb2-cd6a-4f9b-ac6f-9a7386dacc79",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "c2dc5fb2-cd6a-4f9b-ac6f-9a7386dacc79",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Caminando Cinco Pasos\n\nPartiendo del 0, cinco pasos hacia la derecha requieren dos cálculos que ya conocemos:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "| Sumando | Multiplicando |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 = 5 | 5 × 1 = 5 |",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": true,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Tabla 1: Representación de los cinco pasos mediante las matemáticas.*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "02246a91-2cb8-4fcf-aa5c-9c678ce57e96",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "02246a91-2cb8-4fcf-aa5c-9c678ce57e96",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "nerd",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "ad7733f8-38ad-406f-abee-d259e45bf383",
               "text": "Weisstein, Eric W.",
               "page": "https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Subtraction.html",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2010",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Una Nueva Operación\n\nCuando caminamos lejos de un punto de partida, necesitamos medir esa distancia. Ya sabemos sumar o multiplicar los pasos. Ahora presentamos la **resta**, que mide la diferencia entre dos números.\n\nEn nuestros 5 pasos:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5<br />-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;0<br />____________<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5</center></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Cálculo 1</b>: Número de pasos desde el origen.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "f5d92755-a0ce-4cef-9b98-e391041950fd",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "f5d92755-a0ce-4cef-9b98-e391041950fd",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### De Vuelta al Origen\n\nAhora imaginemos que terminamos en nuestro destino, 5 pasos desde el origen, y volvemos el mismo número de pasos. Llegamos otra vez al origen — y podemos mostrarlo con una resta:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5<br />-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5<br />____________<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;0</center></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Cálculo 2</b>: Regreso al origen.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "918c12d2-a14b-4686-abad-7d6b536e5668",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "918c12d2-a14b-4686-abad-7d6b536e5668",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "shocking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Desde Otro Punto de Partida\n\nAhora supongamos que empezamos en la posición 1 y paramos en la posición 9. Para contar los pasos, restamos 1 de 9:",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"text-align=center\"><center>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;9<br />-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1<br />____________<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8</center></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Cálculo 3</b>: Número de pasos entre dos posiciones.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "e1253c1d-a5bd-4e5e-82f1-66890737e4c2",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "e1253c1d-a5bd-4e5e-82f1-66890737e4c2",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### ¡Vamos a Pensar!\n\n¿Podemos leer el signo menos como volver sobre un eje?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "2487e133-e610-426f-aacb-695ee1c5d6c4",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "2487e133-e610-426f-aacb-695ee1c5d6c4",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "nerd",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Una Señal para Regresar\n\nMiremos las dos restas que hicimos. En 5 − 5 = 0 el resultado es menor que el valor de partida, así que retrocedimos por el eje. La resta 9 − 1 = 8 es distinta: es la distancia de la posición 1 a la posición 9, y caminar de 1 a 9 es avanzar por el eje.\n\nEl signo menos (−) indica cambiar de dirección, mientras que el signo más (+), en la suma, nos hace avanzar por el mismo eje.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "6221f0f6-b47e-4d93-8138-2a243b2c3cc7",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "6221f0f6-b47e-4d93-8138-2a243b2c3cc7",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "party",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=964083ad-c587-43dc-9649-5b578714ab44",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusión\n\nEn esta clase conocimos una nueva operación: la **resta**. La usamos para medir distancias y longitudes, y puede indicar el regreso a una posición anterior.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      }
   ]
